n for %d turns, the initial victim will spread the whisper to a new target within %d tiles if one is available; beyond this, all affected targets have a %d%% chance of spreading the effect each turn for 4 turns.\n\nTargets damaged by this ability have a 25%% chance of suffering Brainlock.\n\nThe damage increases with your Mindpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"用恶毒私语感染目标心智，造成 %d 点精神伤害。私语会在敌人之间传播；每感染一个新目标，都会造成伤害并使你获得 %0.1f 点仇恨值。接下来的 %d 回合内，初始目标每回合都会将私语传播给 %d 格范围内的一个新目标（如果存在）；此外，所有受影响目标在 4 回合内每回合有 %d%% 几率传播此效果。\n\n受到此技能伤害的目标有 25%% 几率陷入思维封锁。\n\n伤害受精神强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c0787b4cc6586fa43d78f310346a6cc96233cbbe86a6925743191de731e855f0","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6d2baf21c0bbb05030896ab5c08b3c997b3783336f51f48d2f31f1138c5c8161","logical_entry_identity":"1e516a9b2881b865908b525c9856c21cda9f72d603605826faa110ee3bdc0d19","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The wise ones say that truth is a three-edged sword. And sometimes, the truth hurts.","source_tag":"_t","target":"有些聪明人说真理是把三刃剑。因为有些时候，“真理”是会伤到人的。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f0d7a371fb1801edd033069554622639ab287be21fbc79a0f268a365f88424d4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6d2bf43c87744f6403444e91e6c6a30381c21ba98de4330e8dcf95a67358c47f","logical_entry_identity":"44334b1cbf23fd5938ad3c52b607520417a15fba070370aa1da8b9f600e8cc48","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"recursion","source_tag":"entity keyword","target":"循环"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4b469a09849e6b2078a6295b92cc5f66f81d5d29849fe95769b33e2b72ea0b5b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6d2f1e69b3fac40c387d0a3f5e57c508abc82902a9187a088422b4355a30f780","logical_entry_identity":"2db291baafbccd5fda86083d489fe9d320fa5426f728cb3b8ff447f572c6a355","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"@Source@ increases local gravity.","source_tag":"_t","target":"@Source@增加了局部重力。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"383dad7471b9148b81c696d655415e0760770dc85c28c31f2d54baf7b099615c","c